<title>USA: American Disposal completes acquisitions.</title>
<headline>American Disposal completes acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>BURR RIDGE, Ill. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Disposal Services Inc said Tuesday it has acquired 10 companies in its existing markets since June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Specific financial terms were not disclosed, but the acquisitions were financed with a combination of cash and stock, the company said.</p>
<p>Acquisitions were made in the New England, Missouri, Indiana and Pennsylvania regions, the company said.</p>
<p>American Disposal shares fell 1/2 to 27-1/2 Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company provides solid waste collection, transfer and disposal services in 12 states.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
